  {
   "x": 7.5,
   "y": 1.1,
   "w": 5.4,
   "h": 0.30416666666666664,
   "text": "Reduced model: ∇²Π = 0",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 15,
   "color": "#8EDBD4",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o020",
   "name": "C1-E23 text 20"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.72,
   "y": 1.65,
   "w": 5.180000000000001,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "Incompressible short event: ∇·Δu = 0 and Δu ≃ −∇Π/ρ give\nLaplace's equation for Π.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o021",
   "name": "C1-E23 text 21"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.535,
   "y": 1.7126388888888888,
   "w": 0.09,
   "h": 0.09,
   "fill": "#8EDBD4",
   "line": "#8EDBD4",
   "line_width": 1,
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "o022",
   "name": "C1-E23 ellipse 22"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.72,
   "y": 2.1736111111111107,
   "w": 5.180000000000001,
   "h": 0.6854166666666667,
   "text": "Π is fixed on the boundaries (Π₀ on the driven wall, 0\nat the free surface); the interior follows from geometry\nalone.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o023",
   "name": "C1-E23 text 23"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.535,
   "y": 2.2362499999999996,
   "w": 0.09,
   "h": 0.09,
   "fill": "#8EDBD4",
   "line": "#8EDBD4",
   "line_width": 1,
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "o024",
   "name": "C1-E23 ellipse 24"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.72,
   "y": 2.9090277777777773,
   "w": 5.180000000000001,
   "h": 0.6854166666666667,
   "text": "Here Π = Π₀(1 − θ/θ₀) in a right-angle corner is\nharmonic, so Δu points along circular arcs toward the\nfree side.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o025",
   "name": "C1-E23 text 25"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.535,
   "y": 2.9716666666666662,
   "w": 0.09,
   "h": 0.09,
   "fill": "#8EDBD4",
   "line": "#8EDBD4",
   "line_width": 1,
   "type": "ellipse",
   "id": "o026",
   "name": "C1-E23 ellipse 26"
  },
  {
   "x": 7.72,
   "y": 3.644444444444444,
   "w": 5.180000000000001,
   "h": 0.4736111111111111,
   "text": "Arrow length ∝ 1/r: the impulse gradient is steepest\nnear the corner.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
